✅ 4. yield() vs sleep() vs join()

| Feature                       | `yield()`         | `sleep()`    | `join()`                    |
| ----------------------------- | ----------------- | ------------ | --------------------------  |
| Class                         | Thread            | Thread       | Thread                      |
| Static                        | ✅ Yes             | ✅ Yes      | ❌ No                    |
| Purpose                       | Suggest scheduler | Time delay   | Wait for thread completion  |
| Blocks Thread                 | ❌ No              | ✅ Yes        | ✅ Yes                   |
| Releases Lock                 | ❌ No              | ❌ No         | ❌ No                    |
| Throws `InterruptedException` | ❌ No              | ✅ Yes        | ✅ Yes                   |
| Guaranteed Behavior           | ❌ No              | ✅ Time-based | ✅ Thread completion     |
